#
# File: 046-Bittorrent-tcp-sport123-out-reply-accept.rule
# Title: Allow local Bittorrent server reply to remote Bittorrent client

# BitTorrent services (optional).
tcp sport { $TORRENT_PORT_LAN, $TORRENT_PORT_WAN, $TRACKER_TORRENT_PORT_WAN } ct state new counter accept comment "local-to-remote BitTorrent/TCP/various reply"
